  "description": "👋 Welcome to StockTok! This article we discuss the micro swings of larger swings… a handful of select names continue to provide promising signs, one of which, Philip Morris International (PM) closely resembles our 21 May Mid-Week Movers #2 pick, BTI now up 10.6% since the review.",
  "body_html": "<p><em>👋 Welcome to<strong> <a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok?utm_source=user-menu\">StockTok</a>! </strong>This article we discuss the micro swings of larger swings… a handful of select names continue to provide promising signs, one of which, Philip Morris International (PM) closely resembles our </em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/mid-week-movers-ford-stockor-lucid\">21 May Mid-Week Movers</a><em> #2 pick, BTI now up 10.6% since the review.</em></p><p><em>For more: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em> <em><strong>| <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing for Beginners</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/timothys-stocktok-tracker?r=4z8lgl\">Current Stock Positions</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-daily-update?r=4z8lgl\">Daily Stock Screener</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a></strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to the Stock Screener. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><div><hr></div><p><em><strong>“TIMOTHY! RIVIAN JUST FELL OFF A CLIFF!”</strong></em></p><p>Taking a breath…somewhat of a sigh…I scroll down TradingView to see what carnage beholds of <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$RIVN&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> . Considering market conditions the last 6 months, nothing truly surprises me of late. Rivian, at the time of writing, down a whopping -3.6%. Now don’t get me wrong….after several days of accumulated drops, a loss can get big… and Rivian may in fact get cut. </p><p>But instances like this happen ALL THE TIME. </p><ul><li><p>“Stock ABC just nosedived!”</p></li><li><p>“Stock XYZ is hemorrhaging!”</p></li><li><p>“Stock XXX is plummeting to hell!”</p><p> </p></li></ul><p>Extreme tones and expressions can cause unnecessary fear. When I think of a stock like Rivian, with a market cap of $17B… a “fell of a cliff” moment would be something like -20%….or more, in a single day. That would be a genuine warning signal. But then, over the course of the day, or that week, most if not all of the downward swing is recovered. </p><p>👉 <strong>The smaller the market cap, the more volatile the intraday swings</strong> 👈</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>So…should we sprint to our portfolio and sell? Ultimately, that is up to you. But -3.6%? In my opinion, no… and again, I want to emphasize….sometimes you will cut a loss and those suck. But the primary point is: <strong>Consider the volatility of the asset you are investing based on market cap, and apply that to your trade and risk plan… BEFORE you enter the trade.</strong></p><p>An extreme example:</p><ul><li><p>Apple with a $2.96T market cap drops -10% - Freakout warranted ✅</p></li><li><p>Rigetti with a $4.1TB market cap drops -10% - Freakout NOT warranted ❌</p></li></ul><h4><strong>Swingers Be Swinging</strong></h4><p>Why did we enter Rivian? It wasn’t because the 5 minute chart was looking juicy. It was because Rivian, since January 2024 has formed higher lows. An entire YEAR’s worth of price action data. By definition, Rivian has been in an up trend since May 2024. Along the way, it has had swings downwards of -46%, -32% and -27%. And to be abundantly clear….I will not hold to the bottom of the range. Its easier to take  a small loss, target the next potential breakout and attempt to recoup the small losses with a big win later. But I keep this in my mind….that double digit swings are not uncommon for this stock. And the longer term data is positive. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!29ZG!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0cf9fe75-eb7e-48e5-bd63-a81e2efa8c96_1349x784.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!29ZG!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0cf9fe75-eb7e-48e5-bd63-a81e2efa8c96_1349x784.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!29ZG!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0cf9fe75-eb7e-48e5-bd63-a81e2efa8c96_1349x784.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!29ZG!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0cf9fe75-eb7e-48e5-bd63-a81e2efa8c96_1349x784.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!29ZG!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0cf9fe75-eb7e-48e5-bd63-a81e2efa8c96_1349x784.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!29ZG!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0cf9fe75-eb7e-48e5-bd63-a81e2efa8c96_1349x784.png\" width=\"1349\" height=\"784\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/0cf9fe75-eb7e-48e5-bd63-a81e2efa8c96_1349x784.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:784,&quot;width&quot;:1349,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:96052,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/164560524?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0cf9fe75-eb7e-48e5-bd63-a81e2efa8c96_1349x784.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!29ZG!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0cf9fe75-eb7e-48e5-bd63-a81e2efa8c96_1349x784.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!29ZG!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0cf9fe75-eb7e-48e5-bd63-a81e2efa8c96_1349x784.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!29ZG!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0cf9fe75-eb7e-48e5-bd63-a81e2efa8c96_1349x784.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!29ZG!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0cf9fe75-eb7e-48e5-bd63-a81e2efa8c96_1349x784.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Rivian in bull trend since May 2024, with large swings both direction.</figcaption></figure></div><p>Even when we zoom into the daily, we see that we are still in an uptrend. From 02 May to 07 May, Rivian dropped -10.5%….then proceeded upward. Would the panic attack have been warranted during that retest of the 200 day moving average? Potentially, the power of hindsight allows us to say it was not. Could this pull back be the start of something bigger? Absolutely. YES. MAYBE. And<strong> you should adhere to the stop plan you developed BEFORE the trade…but I urge you to calm your nerves</strong>. </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa4c61c40-9364-4166-877a-b0163fb9610d_854x854.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aCAV!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fee0febc4-d938-4bc6-9b18-26ec5ce760f1_1351x792.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aCAV!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fee0febc4-d938-4bc6-9b18-26ec5ce760f1_1351x792.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aCAV!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fee0febc4-d938-4bc6-9b18-26ec5ce760f1_1351x792.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aCAV!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fee0febc4-d938-4bc6-9b18-26ec5ce760f1_1351x792.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aCAV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fee0febc4-d938-4bc6-9b18-26ec5ce760f1_1351x792.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aCAV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fee0febc4-d938-4bc6-9b18-26ec5ce760f1_1351x792.png\" width=\"1351\" height=\"792\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/ee0febc4-d938-4bc6-9b18-26ec5ce760f1_1351x792.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:792,&quot;width&quot;:1351,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:140583,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/164560524?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fee0febc4-d938-4bc6-9b18-26ec5ce760f1_1351x792.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aCAV!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fee0febc4-d938-4bc6-9b18-26ec5ce760f1_1351x792.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aCAV!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fee0febc4-d938-4bc6-9b18-26ec5ce760f1_1351x792.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aCAV!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fee0febc4-d938-4bc6-9b18-26ec5ce760f1_1351x792.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aCAV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fee0febc4-d938-4bc6-9b18-26ec5ce760f1_1351x792.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Note: Lines on charts mean nothing. I use them for visual reference only. Rivian still in an uptrend. </figcaption></figure></div><p>Rivian did not even have a “large” move today, relative to market cap. At $17B, it would have had to have moved well over 4%. As I type this, it is now sitting at -2.4%. Look at this chart below, and this will give you a good idea by market cap, what a “large” move is. And note, these large moves may be early signals. For example, when <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$SPY&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> dropped more than -4% on 18 December 2024, that was a huge warning signal (and hence why we sold off). A drop of -4% for the S&amp;P 500 is <em><strong>massive </strong></em>considering the size.  But a drop of -4% is a normal Tuesday for a stock below $10B.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2gJp!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faed79ae7-a1e7-4f6d-b22c-bfcfe41233cb_1432x910.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2gJp!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faed79ae7-a1e7-4f6d-b22c-bfcfe41233cb_1432x910.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2gJp!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faed79ae7-a1e7-4f6d-b22c-bfcfe41233cb_1432x910.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2gJp!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faed79ae7-a1e7-4f6d-b22c-bfcfe41233cb_1432x910.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2gJp!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faed79ae7-a1e7-4f6d-b22c-bfcfe41233cb_1432x910.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2gJp!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faed79ae7-a1e7-4f6d-b22c-bfcfe41233cb_1432x910.png\" width=\"1432\" height=\"910\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/aed79ae7-a1e7-4f6d-b22c-bfcfe41233cb_1432x910.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:910,&quot;width&quot;:1432,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:159435,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/164560524?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faed79ae7-a1e7-4f6d-b22c-bfcfe41233cb_1432x910.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2gJp!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faed79ae7-a1e7-4f6d-b22c-bfcfe41233cb_1432x910.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2gJp!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faed79ae7-a1e7-4f6d-b22c-bfcfe41233cb_1432x910.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2gJp!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faed79ae7-a1e7-4f6d-b22c-bfcfe41233cb_1432x910.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2gJp!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faed79ae7-a1e7-4f6d-b22c-bfcfe41233cb_1432x910.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Big daily % changes in orange relative to market cap. I somewhat have this memorized. You should as well over time. Rivian is still within “normal” range (yellow dot).</figcaption></figure></div><p>The point of the article: We may end up cutting Rivian. Rivian was our first major win here on Substack with a 24% gain. <em><strong>But do not let a 5 minute candle, completely erase an analysis you conducted on a daily or weekly or monthly chart</strong></em>. Sometimes I offer the smaller cap stocks a little more “breathing room” with stops as it oscillates up and down on a larger time frame. <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$WNS&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> is another example…a stock that has been in an uptrend since April 2024, but with swings of +50% and -30% along the way. Generally I will not hold more than a -8% loss.  Probably hold true to that rule ~95% of the time.<em><strong> If you do play with smaller stocks, never go full portfolio with any of them</strong></em>. I have seen many devastated with this approach. It’s not “if” but “when” a position will go against you. </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/swingers-be-swinging/comments&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Leave a comment&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/swingers-be-swinging/comments\"><span>Leave a comment</span></a></p><p>Be aware of your tolerances…small caps and mid cap stocks are not for everyone… some people just do not have the emotional capacity to deal with them. AND THAT IS OK! There are plenty of larger cap stocks available as well (though if you’re speculation is incorrect, you will just bleed slower). </p><p>Build a game plan. Determine your stop. Update as you go. And breathe!  </p><div class=\"subscription-widget-wrap-editor\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidgetToDOM\"><div class=\"subscription-widget show-subscribe\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">If you found this article useful, consider subscribing for more daily updates. </p></div><form class=\"subscription-widget-subscribe\"><input type=\"email\" class=\"email-input\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Type your email…\" tabindex=\"-1\"><input type=\"submit\" class=\"button primary\" value=\"Subscribe\"><div class=\"fake-input-wrapper\"><div class=\"fake-input\"></div><div class=\"fake-button\"></div></div></form></div></div>",
